"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-05-30T06:01:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T11:35:43Z","closed_at":"2026-01-08T11:35:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot Version:Reproducible in: 4.4.1 Stable, 4.2.2 Stable\n\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nwin11 3050ti\n\n### Issue description\n\nA circular reference in my project causes a bug where a singleton (game_manager) fails to preload a resource in its _ready method. Specifically, the issue occurs when the Bouleuterion node includes a bug3 method and a scene_manager.gd file exists in the project. This setup triggers a failure in resource loading for game_manager.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\nOpen the house or Bouleuterion scene,Run the project. then inspect the game_manager class to observe the resource loading in the _ready method.\n\nPrevious Workaround (No Longer Effective):\nPreviously, I resolved the issue by adding a preload statement in other scenes, such as house or Bouleuterion, for the resource (e.g., preload(\"res://Asset/tres/bentupai.tres\")). This approach worked temporarily but is no longer effective, possibly because I deleted other code that was necessary for the workaround to function. The deleted code may have resolved the circular reference or altered the loading order.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAttachments:\n(Optional) Minimal reproduction project or code snippets for game_manager.gd, Bouleuterion.gd, and scene_manager.gd to help diagnose the issue.\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20515700/test.zip)\n\nNotes:\nPlease let me know if additional details or a minimal reproduction project are needed to investigate further.\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106955/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}